    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Biex tidħol b’dan it-tagħmir minflok, agħżel uża l-kont online
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSA_Error:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Dan il-qasam huwa meħtieġa.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSATitle:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Issa żid il-mistoqsijiet tas-sigurtà
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSALeadHtml:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: F’każ li tinsa l-password tiegħek, agħżel 3 mistoqsijiet ta’ sigurtà. Żgura li t-tweġibiet ma tinsihomx.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSAErrorVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: You’ll need to finish entering your security questions before you can continue.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSA3VoiceOver:
