  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Ok, now type a password for your account.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordTitle:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Oħloq password memorabbli ħafna
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordReqErrorVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Looks like you didn't meet all the password requirements. Let's try this again.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordPolicy_Error:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Il-password li ktibt ma ssodisfatx ir-rekwiżiti dwar il-kumplessità tal-password stabbiliti mill-amministratur tan-netwerk jew tal-grupp tiegħek. Ikseb ir-rekwiżiti mingħand l-amministratur tiegħek u mbagħad ikteb password ġdida.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordPlaceHolder:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Password
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordLeadHtml:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Żgura li tagħżel xi ħaġa li assolutament tiftakar.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordLabelText:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Daħħal password
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHint_Invalid_Error:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Is-suġġeriment dwar il-password ma jistax jinkludi l-password tiegħek.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHint_Empty_Error:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Hemm bżonn ta' suġġeriment. Kun żgur li jgħinek tiftakar il-password tiegħek.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Great. Now. With an offline account, if you forget your password, the only way to retrieve it is with a hint, so make sure it's memorable.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintTitle:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Żid suġġeriment għall-password tiegħek
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintPlaceHolder:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Suġġeriment għall-password
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintLeadText:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: F’każ li tinsa. Għal darb’oħra, agħmilha kemm jista’ jkun li ma tinsihiex.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintErrorVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: It's important that your password hint doesn't contain your password. That kind of defeats the purpose, really. Go ahead and pick another hint.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordEmpty_Error:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Daħħal password.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordConfirm_Error:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Din il-password ma taqbilx. Erġa' pprova ttajpjaha.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordConfirmVoiceOver:
