    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Face
  \oobeHello\HelloLearnMoreNavigationError:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Jidher li għandna xi kwistjonijiet tal-konnettività - jew m’intix ikkonnettjat mal-internet, jew hemm kwistjoni n-naħa tagħna. Tista’ taqra d-Dikjarazzjoni tal-Privatezza kollha ta’ Microsoft fi kwalunkwe ħin billi tittajpja aka.ms/privacy fl-istrixxa tal-indirizz ta’ kwalunkwe brawżer fuq kwalunkwe tagħmir.
  \oobeHello\HelloLearnMoreLinkText:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Sir af aktar dwar il-protezzjoni tal-kont
  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFingerprint:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: It-tagħmir tiegħek għandu senser tal-marki tas-swaba' li jaħdem ma' Windows Hello, u jagħtik mod sempliċi u bla password biex tivverifika l-identità tiegħek.
  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFace:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Il-kamera tiegħek taħdem ukoll ma’ Windows Hello biex tgħarfek, biex tagħtik mod sempliċi mingħajr password biex tivverifika l-identità tiegħek.
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC with just your fingerprint. It's not only faster, it's more secure than a password. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintIconAriaLabel:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Ikona tal-għarfien bil-marka tas-swaba’ ta’ Windows Hello
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintEnrollmentVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Follow the instructions to teach your PC to read your fingerprints
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC, quick as a wink, with just your face. No wink required. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceIconAriaLabel:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Ikona tal-għarfien bil-wiċċ ta’ Windows Hello
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceEnrollmentVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Ok, hold still for a second. We need to learn to recognize you
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceAnimationAltText:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Animazzjoni tal-għarfien bil-wiċċ ta’ Windows Hello
  \oobeHello\HelloContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Kompli
  \oobeHello\HelloButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Iva, ikkonfigura
  \oobeHello\GoToSettingsBioDataTitle:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Le, ibdel kif nidħol
  \oobeHello\GoToSettingsBioDataSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Ħudni fis-settings fejn nista’ nneħħi l-għażliet tad-dħul u nħassar id-dejta tiegħi.
  \oobeHello\BioConsentTitle:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Agħżel jekk tixtieqx tkompli tidħol b’wiċċek jew bil-marka tas-saba’ tiegħek
  \oobeHello\BioConsentSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Tixtieq tkompli taħżen id-dejta tal-wiċċ jew tal-marki tas-swaba’ tiegħek fuq dan il-PC?
